Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Vehicle encountered stopped car in tunnel" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .
:actor1 a :Vehicle .
:weather1 a :ClearCondition .
:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential risk of rear-end collision due to stopped vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

